# Java Standards
- Java 21, meaningful names.
- Immutable **input** data may use records (`RegistrationData`); API **response** bodies use POJOs with getters/setters.
- Composition over inheritance; keep base classes lightweight.
- No empty catch blocks; no swallowed assertions.
- Agent drafts belong under `agent-generated/`, not `src/`.
